{%- comment -%}
  Besjaar 11.6.8 — catalogue page, collection cards and the product buy box.

  Catalogue (templates/list-collections, section main-list-collections):
  - The hero block (kicker, "One collection. Showerheads.", copy) stays in
    the DOM as the page's h1 but is visually hidden.
  - The "01 / Shower Heads / 4 products" bar becomes the title row.
  - Product cards: product floats on an ice tile (white image backgrounds
    multiplied away), small navy badge, two-line title, spec chips, price,
    stock dot, full-width pill button. Brand/identity row removed.
  - Accessories block and the filter explainer restyled to the same system.

  Product page (section industry-product):
  - Smaller, sharper title; brand kicker in blue; stock as a soft green pill.
  - Judge.me badge hidden while a product has zero reviews.
  - Buy card: price row without the stray hairline, quantity stepper and
    Add-to-cart in one row, rounded payment button, trust tiles, model
    finder row and accordion typography aligned to the token system.

  Temporary carrier like the other besjaar-* sections; fold into
  sections/main-list-collections.liquid, snippets/product-card.liquid and
  assets/besjaar-product-detail.css during the consolidation.
{%- endcomment -%}
